    "Suggested": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建议"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复之前的 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TAR archive": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TAR 压缩包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TAR.BZ2 archive": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TAR.BZ2 压缩包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TAR.GZ archive": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TAR.GZ 压缩包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TAR.XZ archive": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TAR.XZ 压缩包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temporary files": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "临时文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test every file once it’s packed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "压缩后检查每个文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thai (Windows-874)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "泰文（Windows-874）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That extraction is no longer available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此次解压缩的结果已不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That item is no longer in the archive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此项目已不在压缩包中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That password didn’t work. Check it and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码不正确。请检查后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s %lld× the size of the archive. Make sure there’s room before extracting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是压缩包大小的 %lld 倍。解压缩前请确认空间充足。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Finder extension is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "访达扩展已开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app it used before (%@) isn’t installed any more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之前使用的 App（%@）已不再安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The background picture, volume icon and “drag here” shortcuts only lay out this disk image’s window in Finder. They’re hidden and won’t be extracted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "背景图片、宗卷图标和“拖到这里”快捷方式仅用于布置访达中的磁盘映像窗口。它们已隐藏，解压缩时也会忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The certificate isn’t one macOS trusts for apps, so the signature says nothing about who made it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 不信任此 App 证书，因此无法通过签名确认制作者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk image asks for this to be copied here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "磁盘映像要求将此项目拷贝到这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fonts are installed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字体已安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installed one moves to the Trash, so you can put it back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装的版本将移到废纸篓，之后可以放回原处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The license text is unavailable in this build. 7-Zip’s license is included with the embedded Stow Engine service in distributed builds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此构建版本中无法显示许可证文本。发行版本的内嵌 Stow 引擎服务中包含 7-Zip 许可证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new archive didn’t arrive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未收到新压缩包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new archive didn’t pass its check, so it wasn’t kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新压缩包未通过检查，因此未予保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The password is incorrect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码不正确。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There’s no signature, so there’s no way to tell who made it or whether it was changed. macOS will block it the first time it opens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 App 没有签名，无法确认制作者或是否被更改。macOS 会阻止其首次打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There’s nothing here to compress.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里没有可压缩的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third-party notices": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第三方声明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This account can’t add things to “%@”. Ask an administrator, or install somewhere else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此账户无法向“%@”添加项目。请联系管理员，或安装到其他位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This archive doesn’t say how its names are encoded. Pick the one where the names read right.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此压缩包未注明文件名编码。请选择能正确显示名称的编码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This archive isn’t on disk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此压缩包不在磁盘上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This archive needs a password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此压缩包需要密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This disk image is encrypted. Stow can’t look inside encrypted images yet — open it in Finder to enter its password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此磁盘映像已加密。Stow 暂不支持查看加密映像，请在访达中打开并输入密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file isn’t an archive Stow can open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stow 无法将此文件作为压缩包打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To install fonts, Stow needs permission to add them to your font library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要安装字体，请允许 Stow 将字体添加到你的字体库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To install “%@”, Stow needs permission to add apps to this folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要安装“%@”，请允许 Stow 将 App 添加到此文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To open “%@” in Installer, Stow unpacks it next to the archive for a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要在安装器中打开“%@”，Stow 会暂时将其解压缩到压缩包所在的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too large to list here": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内容过多，无法在此列出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too large to preview here — press Space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件过大，无法在此预览，请按空格键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top level": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顶层"
          }
        }
      }
