    "in 700 MB parts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分为 700 MB 的分卷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS can’t find this copy of Stow. Move it to Applications and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 找不到此 Stow 副本。请将其移到“应用程序”后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS doesn’t let a sandboxed app remove it, so Gatekeeper checks “%@” the first time it opens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 不允许沙盒中的 App 移除此标记，因此“%@”首次打开时仍会接受安全检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS kept %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 保留了%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS marks apps that came from the internet so Gatekeeper can check them the first time they open. Removing the mark skips that check — only turn this on if you trust everything you install. Unsigned or unnotarized apps still get a warning from Stow first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 会标记来自互联网的 App，以便在首次打开时执行安全检查。移除标记会跳过此检查，请仅在信任所有安装内容时开启。对于未签名或未经公证的 App，Stow 仍会先显示警告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS needs your OK in Login Items settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在“登录项”设置中允许 Stow。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS will ask before opening it. Only run it if you trust whoever sent this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 会在打开前询问。请仅在信任发送者时运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "no app": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无 App"
          }
        }
